#: ../../zh/triton_api/Atomic_Ops/atomic_min.md
msgid ""
"指定操作的内存语义<br>社区官方配置可接受的值为“acquire”、“release”、“acq_rel”（默认，代表“ACQUIRE_RELEASE”）和“relaxed”<br>我们只支持“acq_rel”：<br>-"
" "
"acquire：获取锁后，能够看到之前的释放操作（相当于一个“读取”操作，并且这个读取操作会阻塞，直到能够读取到“最新”的数据，也就是其他线程释放后的数据）<br>-"
" release：在释放锁之前的所有操作，对后续获取锁的线程可见（相当于一个“写入”操作，并且这个写入操作会“同步”所有之前的写操作）"
msgstr ""
"Specifies the memory semantics of the operation<br>Acceptable values in the "
"upstream community configuration are \"acquire\", \"release\", \"acq_rel\" "
"(default, representing \"ACQUIRE_RELEASE\") and \"relaxed\"<br>We only "
"support \"acq_rel\":<br>- acquire: After acquiring the lock, sees all prior "
"release operations (equivalent to a \"read\" operation that blocks until the"
" \"latest\" data released by other threads is visible)<br>- release: All "
"operations before releasing the lock are visible to threads that "
"subsequently acquire the lock (equivalent to a \"write\" operation that "
"\"synchronizes\" all prior writes)"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Atomic_Ops/atomic_min.md
msgid "`scope`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Atomic_Ops/atomic_min.md
msgid ""
"观察原子操作同步效果的线程范围<br>可接受的值为“gpu”（默认）、“cta”（协作线程数组、线程块）或“sys”（代表“SYSTEM”） "
"<br>我们只支持“gpu”"
msgstr ""
"The thread scope observing the synchronization effect of the atomic "
"operation<br>Acceptable values are \"gpu\" (default), \"cta\" (cooperative "
"thread array, thread block), or \"sys\" (representing \"SYSTEM\") <br>We "
"only support \"gpu\""

